    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d190">

                <pb facs="0242" n="192" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg192"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Rengifo.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-09-25"><hi rendition="#italic">September 25,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 21st instant, officially informing me of the death of His
                    Excellency Señor Dr. Don Rafael Nuñez, the titular President of the Republic of
                    Colombia.</p>
                <p>I beg of you to make known to the minister for foreign affairs of Colombia the
                    deep sorrow with which this Government learns of this sad event.</p>
                <p>Accept, sir, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
